{"ID":"20240513083408-sjtjml6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083408-sjtjml6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083408-sjtjml6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105629-qb2sqac\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105629-qb2sqac\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:610,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105629-qb2sqac\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:552,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:552\u0026#125;","title":"047","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124130"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513105629-qb2sqac","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 948px;","id":"20240513105629-qb2sqac","updated":"20240515124130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/02"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"037-2 G, A"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壯"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/5/7"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：回診, 血壓高 140/100"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠: 很好, 可通宵"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便: 很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 體重: 減輕12 磅 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 血壓: "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140/100 (血壓偏高乃腎陽虛之故)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 四肢: 雙足手在B.P.高時會較冷(心熱因腎陽不足無法傳至腳端而反逆致呈現高血壓)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 其它: 此人很緊張"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" N/A"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、舌診： 黃濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、眼診：瞳孔光反應極差(腎陽沒了,被嚇到), 肝區有褐色斑點(肝內積毒)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、耳診:心點有痛點其它 : 髮乾(腎陰不足);"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 腎陽不足"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方：  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子四錢  遠志五錢  澤瀉四錢  茯苓五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天三錢  豬苓三錢  丹皮三錢  黃芩三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢  黃柏三錢  大黃二錢  桂枝三錢   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麥冬五錢  川芎三錢  生地二錢  南星三錢  半夏三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗 "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.病患"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1)睡眠轉好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)大便變正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3)體重減輕"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→表心臟功能在恢復中"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.高血壓藥會致性慾低下 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.高血壓藥會有利水的副作用,長久使用會造成血管壁脆化而易血管破裂 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.心熱反逆至肺則呈現黃苔, 反逆至心包則生痰飲 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.川芎可保護血管壁，使血管的彈性好，不易破裂 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.肺為腎之母，當腎陽起來時才可以深吸氣，此時金可生水，腎可得到營養則頭髮會光亮。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}